    "en": "Soft standing knee, tip forward and let your back leg rise"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "cue2",
   "primary": false,
   "text": {
    "zh": "后腿和上身一条线，胯别歪。",
    "en": "Back leg and body in one line, hips level."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "cue3",
   "primary": false,
   "text": {
    "zh": "两手自然垂下，背挺平。",
    "en": "Arms hang straight down, back flat."
   }
  }
 ],
